5189_4915271146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cZH5AEYdXCkQ7kNvwH7hKtT&_nc_oc=Adq3gh6ilzM3pvJg8m-uULNhlyIohbWmBtAWA77srg5PfmzZ4G31GEyajS7aIIjVFtM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_yFa_mfO_1Uf0RTXH6y-0L-4yppdlMA5DU00k9tFlNhw&oe=6A466339"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hAQ1pB0gIBIQ7kNvwHNpNMK&_nc_oc=AdoUaqwWp_qDTBLZ4TE4GdunxK4FjJjfaiJXhrtXZ0ooDUnhgyHjNkvSwskVDl_giVk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_Q9bEXnp8bR6ETOHmf5sWOR3mfjwBLeNIuo49KF7P_Pw&oe=6A467613"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R2osYgmpC_gQ7kNvwE7jt7t&_nc_oc=Adqi1IWpVnd-v63aClEZYUq34HPJvF-wwNcqnXsViKkjQGD26AD0e2QddCfZWQ2i60A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9QLSalDGPbllUjpK6TYXA4u_u8QMqFCgVMxMML1hKB3Q&oe=6A46745A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_u